      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "皆さん、お疲れ様でした。\nレッスン以上の最高のパフォーマンスでしたよ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "narration",
      "source_text": "お疲れさまでした！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "…さっきの……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "九十九 一希"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……さっきのステージ、見てたけど。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドルA"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "F-LAGSは俺たちと同じ、\nちゃんとしたアイドルだったよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドルA"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……まぁ、あの秋月涼がいるユニットだからな。\nもともと格下だなんて思ってなかったんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドルB"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "でも、現場の緊張感に影響されたっていうか……。\nライバルとしてカッコ悪いことして、悪かったな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドルC"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "えっ……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋月 涼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ラ、ライバル！？\n男の子にライバル認定されるなんて、感動だよ～～！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋月 涼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "わはは。ワシらはデビューしたてじゃけぇ。涼と\n同じでライバルが増えるのは嬉しい！　のぉ先生！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "…ああ。おれたちも、あなたたちのパフォーマンス\nから学ばせてもらう。アイドルというものを。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "九十九 一希"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 23
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ははっ……こっちこそ！\n次に共演があったら楽しみにしてるぜ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドルA"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-25:text",
        "step_id": 25,
        "step_index": 24,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 24
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "現場の皆さんの雰囲気が、\n一気に明るくなりましたね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-30:text",
        "step_id": 30,
        "step_index": 29,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 29
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "えへへ、僕の気持ちもさらに明るくなってます！\nやっぱり、久々の歌番組で緊張してたのかも。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋月 涼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-31:text",
        "step_id": 31,
        "step_index": 30,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 30
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "…そうだろうな。だがそれでも、\nおれたちのステージは確かに人を笑顔にできた。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "九十九 一希"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-32:text",
        "step_id": 32,
        "step_index": 31,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 31
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "…カメラのこちら側の、全員が笑顔なんだ。\nきっと、視聴者にも気持ちは伝染するだろう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "九十九 一希"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-33:text",
        "step_id": 33,
        "step_index": 32,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 32
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_text": "数日後……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-38:caption",
        "step_id": 38,
        "step_index": 37,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 37
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "放送、終わったね！\nファンのみんな、\n楽しんでくれたかな？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋月 涼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-41:text",
        "step_id": 41,
        "step_index": 40,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 40
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "きっとみんな笑顔に\nなってくれたはずじゃ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-42:text",
        "step_id": 42,
        "step_index": 41,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 41
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "しかし、ワシの緊張が\nテレビ越しにも\n伝わってきたのぉー…",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-43:text",
        "step_id": 43,
        "step_index": 42,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 42
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おれも似たようなものだ。\nトーク中は、特に緊張が\n顔に出ていた。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "九十九 一希"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-44:text",
        "step_id": 44,
        "step_index": 43,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 43
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "その点、涼は普段と変わり\nなかったと思う。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "九十九 一希"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-45:text",
        "step_id": 45,
        "step_index": 44,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 44
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おー、ワシも同じことを\n思っとった！あれは慣れと\n経験の差じゃな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_i:step-46:text",
        "step_id": 46,
        "step_index": 45,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 51,
          "target_step_index": 45
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "本当？\nすごく緊張してるのが\nわかる顔だったんだけどね<emoji>image_talk_emoji_14</emoji>",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
